{"nodes": [{"id": "_opencode_command_report_report", "label": "/report (espejo OpenCode)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".opencode/command/report.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_opencode_command_report_despacho_explicito_de_subagentes", "label": "Despacho explicito de subagentes por rol", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".opencode/command/report.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un solo task por rol, con el nombre del rol y su <run_dir>/<role>.bc.json en la primera linea. Lanzar varios workers identicos con un prompt compartido obliga a cada uno a adivinar si es historical, inference o expert-alignment; esa ambiguedad hay que cancelarla y relanzarla antes del render. Un worker sin permiso de Bash tampoco puede terminar un rol y deja la corrida estancada sin decirlo."}, {"id": "_opencode_command_report_registro_de_uso_y_duracion", "label": "record-usage / record-duration / verify-usage", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".opencode/command/report.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El total de tokens solo se pasa si el runtime lo entrega estructurado; nunca se raspa de prosa, historia de sesion o tamano de salida. Si no lo hay, se omite la etapa y el render la etiqueta como estimada. La duracion es siempre del orquestador (reloj de pared). El modelo se nombra por bandera explicita o por CHEC_LLM_PROVIDER/CHEC_LLM_MODEL; dejarlo en 'Desconocido' es honesto, inventar un valor por defecto no."}], "edges": [{"source": "_opencode_command_report_report", "target": "readme_report_pipeline", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".opencode/command/report.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_opencode_command_report_report", "target": "readme_report_contract", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".opencode/command/report.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_opencode_command_report_report", "target": "agents_espejos_generados", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".opencode/command/report.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_opencode_command_report_despacho_explicito_de_subagentes", "relation": "rationale_for", "target": "_opencode_command_report_report", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".opencode/command/report.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_opencode_command_report_registro_de_uso_y_duracion", "relation": "rationale_for", "target": "_opencode_command_report_report", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".opencode/command/report.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_opencode_command_report_report", "target": "readme_report", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".opencode/command/report.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}